  "description": "\"You're coming back after 3 years.\"\n\nJaejun was suffering from extreme trauma and nightmares.\n\nWith the obituary of the priest who took care of himself who became an orphan\n\nA pseudo-religious group that ran away 3 years ago\n\nStep back into 'Jin Jerusalem'.\n\nI'm reunited with Raphael, who I've always longed for living together there for...\n\n\"Brother, why... The same denial as the priest...\"\n\n\"It's ridiculous...! How did you... Brother, how can you do this?\"\n\nShockingly, Raphael, whom I haven't seen in a long time, was depraved without knowing the bottom, repeating sexuous sex.\n\nThe excretion of distorted desire that takes place under the name of faith and 'Euly ceremony'. Jaejun feels uncomfortable,\n\nAfter returning to Jin Jerusalem, I no longer have nightmares and feel paradoxical peace in the process of feeling sexually attracted to Raphael.\n\n\"Jaejun before you leave... I want to share God's grace with you.\"\n\n\"Is there really such a thing as God's grace as you said?\"\n\nJaejun, who had a relationship called God's grace from Raphael,\n\nI can't stand the daily life without Raphael anymore.\n\nSoon, Min Jae-joon, who claimed to re-enter the church as a believer in Jerusalem who was only for Raphael.\n\nI thought I might become a blind believer who was fascinated by the physical relationship with Raphael pretending not to know...\n\nPark Tae-chon, the owner of the school, is strange.\n\n\"Do you really believe in Kyoju?\"\n\nThe orgy called the Euchist is not Raphael's choice.\n\nAnd the bizarre steps of Park Tae-chon Kyoju who show his own presence.\n\nIn order to protect Raphael, Min Jae-joon decides to melt deeper into 'Jin Jerusalem'...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5699000521)",
